# T76 part 2 (row I167a): the LRU trim runs after LIBRARY_FETCH (src/library/db/fetch.c). The TFMX song is kept,
# so it and its smpl.* companion survive a budget far below their size; an older unmarked file is evicted.
@mark kept:modland:TFMX/test/mdat.song
@budget 10
LIBRARY_FETCH modland:TFMX/test/mdat.song
